          },
          "link": null
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Text to Image · MOSS-Image\n\n**Geekatplay Studio** · ComfyUI-Cluster\n\nThe same planner-driven pipeline, pinned to MOSS-Image and wired the way the official template is: FLUX.2 latent, skip layer guidance on layer 22, er_sde sampler.\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Start Ollama.\n2. Write your prompt. Put any text that must appear in the image in quotes.\n3. Press **Run**.\n\n## Reading the graph\n\nGroups run left to right and are numbered in the order they execute. The **Status** row at the bottom shows what the planner decided and what the loader did.\n\n## If something fails\n\n- **Model not installed**: the loader error lists the exact files and download links. Run `install.bat`.\n- **Planner says tag matching**: Ollama was not reachable or the model tag is not pulled. The workflow still runs; the summary shows the reason.\n"
      ],
      "title": "About this workflow",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        958
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "text",
          "type": "STRING",
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          },
          "link": null
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Models\n\nThis workflow is pinned to **MOSS-Image** with `task_hint = moss_image`. MOSS-Image is strong at readable text, posters and layouts in English and Chinese.\n\n## Files\n\n- `models/diffusion_models/`\n  [moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors) (5.4 GB)\n- `models/text_encoders/`\n  [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors) (7.3 GB)\n- `models/vae/`\n  [flux2-vae_small.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors) (0.25 GB)\n\n`install.bat` downloads all three. Licence: Apache 2.0.\n\n## Settings used\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Steps / CFG | 25 / 2.5 |\n| Sampler | er_sde, simple |\n| Skip layer | 22, first half of sampling |\n| Size | about 1 megapixel, sides in steps of 16 |\n\nThese follow the official ComfyUI MOSS-Image template. For results closer to the model authors' reference, set `steps` to 50 and `cfg` to 3 in the registry entry.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Put text you want rendered inside quotes.\n- A negative prompt is used here because CFG is above 1. Leave `user_negative` empty to get the recommended default.\n\n## Ollama\n\n```\nollama pull qwen3.5:9b\n```"
      ],
      "title": "Models and setup",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
  ],
